{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08842","headline":"嘲鲁儒 · 李白","name":"嘲鲁儒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁叟谈五经，白发死章句。\n问以经济策，茫如坠烟雾。\n足着远游履，首戴方山巾。\n缓步从直道，未行先起尘。\n秦家丞相府，不重褒衣人。\n君非叔孙通，与我本殊伦。\n时事且未达，归耕汶水滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"薛天纬"}